/Subject (MC9S08SG8: The MC9S08SG8 members of the low-cost, high-performance S08 family of 8-bit microcontroller units \(MCUs\). All MCUs in the family use the enhanced S08 core and are available with a variety of modules, memory sizes, memory types, and package types.  This MC9S08SG8 has the following features: 40 MHz S08 CPU, 20-TSSOP, 16-TSSOP.)
