               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">MC9S08SG8, MC9S08SG4 - Data Sheet</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:title>
         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">MC9S08SG8: The MC9S08SG8 members of the low-cost, high-performance S08 family of 8-bit microcontroller units (MCUs). All MCUs in the family use the enhanced S08 core and are available with a variety of modules, memory sizes, memory types, and package types.  This MC9S08SG8 has the following features: 40 MHz S08 CPU, 20-TSSOP, 16-TSSOP.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:description>
         <dc:subject>
            <rdf:Bag>
               <rdf:li>MC9S08SG8</rdf:li>
